      47.85,
      426.73,
      537.97,
      528.16
    ],
    "text": "I, Maithripala Sirisena, President of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do hereby, in the exercise of powersvested in me by Section 4 of the Commission of Inquiry Act (Chapter 393), enlarge the time by two and a half months(2 1/2) from 14th July, 2019 for rendition of the final report on completion of the tasks assigned to the Commissionestablished under Section 2 of the said Commission of Inquiry Act on 14th January, 2019 by Notification published in theGazette Extraordinary No. 2106/11 dated 16th January, 2019 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka toinvestigate and inquire into acts of corruption, fraud, criminal breach of trust, criminal misappropriation of property,cheating and abuse or misuse of power or authority, state resources and privilegs which offences and acts of wrong doinghad allegedly occurred during the period 15th January, 2015 to 31st December, 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
